# ---- Claude Code session data (local only, never committed) ----
# Keep only the project-specific contributor skill under version control.
.claude/*
!.claude/
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/iustitia-contributor/
!.claude/skills/iustitia-contributor/SKILL.md

# ---- Local research corpus (third-party anticheat/cheat source, kept local) ----
References/

# ---- Unwired WIP feature drafts (parked outside the build, never committed) ----
wip/

# ---- Local working/research notes (superseded by README.md, kept local) ----
Anticheat Documentation.txt
Minecraft_Cheat_AntiCheat_Findings.md
Reference Analysis & Detection Plan.md
Development Plan.md

# ---- Local reference copy of a prior release (kept local, never committed) ----
oldversion/

# ---- Website (now maintained in the Portfolio repo → https://thoria.fyi/iustitia) ----
# The docs site is generated by scripts/gen_docs.py (from scripts/checks.json) and synced into the
# Portfolio repo's iustitia/ subdir on each release (procedure: .claude/skills/docs-sync/). The
# generated HTML/CSS/JS is NOT committed to this repo — only the generator (scripts/) + dev docs
# (docs/*.md, docs/superpowers/) live here. These patterns keep a local `gen_docs.py` run from
# cluttering git.
/index.html
/docs/*.html
/assets/

# ---- Claude Code / commit-message scratch (local only, never committed) ----
.commit-msg.txt
*.tmp

# ---- Internal AI-assistant / dev workflow docs (local only, never committed) ----
# Kept on disk for local dev (Claude Code + superpowers plan/spec workflow) but
# never served on GitHub. The /docs/ subpath pattern matches the entire
# docs/superpowers/ tree (plans + specs).
#
# These three are a DELIBERATE privacy guard from the 27ea0c0 repo-exposure audit, not leftover
# drift — `CLAUDE.md` is simply absent right now, and the pattern is here so it stays out of the
# public repo if it comes back. Do not "clean them up" because the files are missing.
CLAUDE.md
/docs/TUNING.md
/docs/superpowers/
